455	    <h2>metric: Gate Quality Before Commit</h2>
456	    <p style="color:var(--muted);max-width:700px">Reads git diff and evaluates every change against the four Karpathy Principles — auto-detects over-engineering, drive-by edits, and missing assumptions.</p>
