461	      <tr><td>P2</td><td>Simplicity First</td><td>No over-engineering? 200 lines → 50?</td></tr>
462	      <tr><td>P3</td><td>Surgical Changes</td><td>Every line traces to the goal?</td></tr>
463	      <tr><td>P4</td><td>Goal-Driven Execution</td><td>Verifiable completion criteria?</td></tr>
