209	<body>
210	
211	<div class="deck" id="deck">
212	
213	  <!-- 0. Title -->
214	  <div class="slide slide-dark slide-center active">
215	    <div class="eyebrow">harness-traj-weaver</div>
216	    <h1>Meta-Harness</h1>
217	    <p class="subtitle">The Self-Improving Loop for AI-Coded Software</p>
218	    <p style="margin-top:var(--sp-xxl);font-size:14px;color:var(--on-dark-soft)">Three principles · Three skills · One hook</p>
219	    <div class="keypoint">AI-coded software needs a self-reviewing harness, not just more tests</div>
